From mtmorgan at fhcrc.org  Thu Jan 12 21:50:46 2006
From: mtmorgan at fhcrc.org (Martin Morgan)
Date: Thu, 12 Jan 2006 12:50:46 -0800
Subject: [BioC] openMosix and R
