From sdavis2 at mail.nih.gov  Fri Jan 13 19:02:41 2006
From: sdavis2 at mail.nih.gov (Sean Davis)
Date: Fri, 13 Jan 2006 13:02:41 -0500
Subject: [BioC] presence/absence call using oligo array?
