From jmacdon at med.umich.edu  Fri Jan 27 20:01:57 2006
From: jmacdon at med.umich.edu (James W. MacDonald)
Date: Fri, 27 Jan 2006 14:01:57 -0500
Subject: [BioC] Differential Gene Expression using limma
In-Reply-To: <1138378172.15520.29.camel@haemoglobin.cs.ucl.ac.uk>
